# LeakSanitizer suppressions for tests that load a Vulkan ICD.
# Mesa RADV 26.2.4 leaks one 256-byte pthread_once allocation per process (reproduced with a bare
# vkCreateInstance/vkDestroyInstance); the ICD is dlclose()d, so only the pthread_once frame is
# symbolised. Needs LSAN_OPTIONS=fast_unwind_on_malloc=0 to see that frame.
leak:pthread_once
